      "message": "rows() disables every existing checklist (c.Disabled = true) for all reminders before rebuilding. Only visible reminders have checklistFor called and re-enabled. Checklists retained for reminders hidden by a filter stay disabled, which is harmless while hidden, but the disable-then-reenable pattern relies on every visible row going through checklistFor. Also the scheduleView picker is never disabled while pending, so it can mutate view state mid-settlement.",
